    "field": "Dependency status",
    "order": 30,
    "content": {
     "text": "one of four constituent countries of the Kingdom of the Netherlands; full autonomy in internal affairs obtained in 1986 upon separation from the Netherlands Antilles; Dutch government responsible for defense and foreign affairs",
